					},
					{
						"@type": "Question",
						"name": "How does Vectis Mail pricing compare to Microsoft 365 per-user licensing?",
						"acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Microsoft 365 and Exchange Online are priced per user per month. Exchange Online Plan 1 is about $4/user/month and Plan 2 about $8/user/month on annual commitment; Microsoft 365 Business Standard rises to $14/user/month from 1 July 2026. That bill scales linearly with headcount. Vectis Mail is flat: Starter is $0 self-hosted, and Pro is $39 USD per tenant per month for unlimited mailboxes and domains. At 50 mailboxes, Business Standard runs about $700/month while Vectis Mail Pro plus a VPS is roughly $59/month — the gap widens with every seat you add." }
